-- ---------- 3. UNIQUE constraints (18 declared) ------------------------------------
-- Only acts when a constraint is missing AND the key has no duplicates: builds the unique
-- index CONCURRENTLY under the constraint's name, then attaches it with
-- ADD CONSTRAINT ... UNIQUE USING INDEX (brief lock, no table scan).
